<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n11755" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">crystallĭnus</span></b> , a, um,
			adj., = <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κρυστάλλινος</span>,
			<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b><i>made of
				crystal, crystalline, crystal</i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b>
			<i>Adj.</i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">calices,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Capitol. Ver. 5</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">pila,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Plin.
					37, 2, 10, § 28</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">centra in sapphiris,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">id.
					37, 9, 39, § 120</span></i>
			.—</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>II.</b>
			<i>Subst.</i>: <b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">crystallĭ-num</span></b> , i,
			n. (sc. vas), <i><span class="en">Sen.
				Ira, 3, 40, 2</span></i>.— Mostly <i>plur</i>, <i><span class="en">Juv. 6, 155</span></i>; <i><span class="en">Mart. 1,
				53, 6</span></i>; <i><span class="en">9, 59,
				13</span></i>; <i><span class="en">Plin. 37, 2, 11, § 30</span></i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">PRAEPOSITVS A CRYSTALLINIS,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Inscr. Orell. 2953</span></i>
			.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
